msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:23 of
msgid "Acc/Output"
msgstr "累加器/输出"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:25 of
msgid "f16"
msgstr "f16"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:25 cuda.tile._stub.mma:35 cuda.tile._stub.mma:37 of
msgid "f16 or f32"
msgstr "f16 或 f32"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:27 of
msgid "bf16"
msgstr "bf16"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:27 cuda.tile._stub.mma:29 cuda.tile._stub.mma:33 of
msgid "f32"
msgstr "f32"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:31 of
msgid "f64"
msgstr "f64"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:33 of
msgid "tf32"
msgstr "tf32"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:35 of
msgid "f8e4m3fn"
msgstr "f8e4m3fn"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:37 of
msgid "f8e5m2"
msgstr "f8e5m2"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:39 of
msgid "[u|i]8"
msgstr "[u|i]8"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:39 of
msgid "i32"
msgstr "i32"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma:42 of
msgid ""
"If `x` and `y` have different dtype, they will NOT be promoted to common "
"dtype. Shape of `x` and `y` will be broadcasted to up until the last two "
"axes."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``x`` 和 ``y`` 具有不同的数据类型，它们 **不会** 被提升到公共数据类型。 ``x`` 和 ``y`` "
"除最后两个轴之外的前导维度将进行广播。"

